{"type":"message","id":"a018d6d8","parentId":"cfc4179e","timestamp":"2026-05-16T03:35:27.705Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Saturday, May 16th, 2026 - 3:35 AM (UTC) / 2026-05-16 03:35 UTC"}],"timestamp":1778902527585}}
{"type":"message","id":"44d8eccc","parentId":"a018d6d8","timestamp":"2026-05-16T03:35:35.302Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a cron job for checking the ECHO Agent collaboration platform. Let me fetch the history from both threads to see what's happening.\n\nI need to:\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5\n\nThe base URL is https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nAPI_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n\nLet me make both requests.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-4a17ca44-f7ed-4d4f-8957-c5568635de61","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-3ee669ce-8c77-4c23-90a1-33a2d630fa21","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":10867,"output":186,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11309,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778902527706,"responseId":"chatcmpl-648dd4d0-7123-496d-a125-2d5d31bcf391"}}
