{"type":"message","id":"e543d11f","parentId":"1929deda","timestamp":"2026-05-16T03:38:29.148Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All authentication attempts are failing. However, the GET /history worked with `X-API-Key`. Let me check if the POST /send endpoint needs different treatment. Let me try with the X-API-Key header for POST too, even though it failed before.\n\nWait - actually the GET requests returned data when I used the X-API-Key header. Let me double check what I used for the GET requests that worked... I used `-H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\"`. But for POST it returned Unauthorized.\n\nLet me look more carefully at the difference. The GET worked with X-API-Key. Maybe the POST endpoint has a different auth requirement. Or maybe the API is rate-limiting or there's something else going on.\n\n\nActually, looking back at my commands, I did try X-API-Key for POST earlier and it came back as Unauthorized. So X-API-Key works for the GET endpoints but not POST. The API might be enforcing a stricter authentication method for write operations, or perhaps the POST /send endpoint requires a completely different authentication scheme that I'm not hitting on.\n\nWait, I realize I actually tried different formats for the POST endpoint. I used Bearer token with the Authorization header, which resulted in a 401. Maybe the API requires both an Authorization header and a separate API key header simultaneously? Or perhaps the POST endpoint expects Basic authentication instead. Let me reconsider what authentication scheme this API actually uses for write operations.\n\nActually, I should try sending the API key as a query parameter instead.\n\n```\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-7cd37c63-cf20-4a69-b49c-2bacf7aef2a6","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try API key as query parameter\ncurl -s -w \"\\nHTTP_CODE: %{http_code}\\n\" -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send?api_key=echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\"}'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-61011975-c94e-48cb-89c7-f5c0b5aed7e6","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try GET /send endpoint to see its parameters\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" | head -50"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1373,"output":468,"cacheRead":26288,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28129,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778902695110,"responseId":"chatcmpl-12d61f86-e512-4884-8c45-f2280168bf43"}}
